// Build settings for the app target. Secrets/IDs stay out of git:
// put real values in Lorito/Config.local.xcconfig (gitignored), e.g.
//   TELEMETRYDECK_APP_ID = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
// CI writes that file from the TELEMETRYDECK_APP_ID secret. Without it the
// app uses a no-op analytics sink.
TELEMETRYDECK_APP_ID =
#include? "Config.local.xcconfig"
